{
  "_comment": [
    "Recorded HID frames from an EPOS|Sennheiser GSA 70 dongle and GSP 670",
    "headset, using the vendor 'Capricorn' HID protocol.",
    "",
    "Wire layout of a 107-byte output report:",
    "    [0]     = 0x01 report id",
    "    [1..4]  = EB FE 01 00 sync",
    "    [5..6]  = marker (host=04 00, device=10 01, ack=05 30, nak=04 10,",
    "                       event-burst=00 01, event-poll=ff 01)",
    "    [7..8]  = opcode, little endian",
    "    [9..10] = payload length, little endian",
    "    [11]    = CRC-8(payload), poly 0x07, init 0xFF",
    "    [12]    = 0x00 filler",
    "    [13..]  = payload",
    "",
    "All entries are complete 107-byte reports. The event and sub-reply",
    "entries are real frames captured from the device; the `secom_*` entries",
    "were captured from the device's replies to the matching requests.",
    "See docs/protocol-reference.md for the full field layout."
  ],
